  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Countering Violent Extremism</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project strengthens member countries&apos; ability to counter violent extremism. It will achieve this by providing technical assistance to identified member countries with a view to a) incrementally strengthening good governance and the rule of law in the policies and practices applied to the management of terrorism; b) build the capability and the relationships required to prevent or manage violent extremism, including a systematic CVE policy and measures that activate one or more of the mechanisms to prevent and counter violent extremism; c) systematic pro-social steps to rehabilitate and reintegrate individuals that radicalised and/or joined violent extremist groups.</narrative>
  </description>
